@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #F8FBFF
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
participant "Student / Browser" as Browser
participant "React client" as React
participant "Kubernetes Service" as Service
participant "Node / Pod" as Node
participant "Agent SDK runtime" as Sdk
participant "Claude API" as Claude
Browser -> React : 1. Run prompt
React -> Service : 2. POST to the same-origin API
Service -> Service : 3. Select ready application Pods
Service -> Node : 4. Deliver to the Node container
Node -> Sdk : 5. Start real SDK runtime
Sdk -> Claude : 6. Exchange messages with Claude
loop streamed SDK messages
Sdk -> Node : 7. Project a safe SDK message
Node -> Service : 8. Flush the Node SSE response
Node -> React : 9. Keep the stream active
end
alt complete
Sdk -> Node : 10. Normalize final result
React -> React : 11. Validate final result event
React -> Browser : 12. Render safe colored Markdown
Node -> Service : 13. Complete result plus done
else failure
Node -> React : 14. Send safe stream failure
React -> Browser : 15. Show recoverable error
else missing key or invalid input
Node -> React : 16. Reject missing model key
end
@enduml
